    "gaps": [
      "Inputs exclude inventories exceeding 10000 skills or 10000 contracts; native code has no such cap. Empty scans run one guarded no-op packing iteration and visit no items; exactly 10000 items complete normally on the last iteration. Exhaustion is unreachable for admissible inputs; native code defines no exhaustion failure.",
      "Wall-time and operation-call limits are descriptor budgets, not native enforced limits; the registered action has timeout_seconds=null.",
      "The graph models audit_skill_coverage. Hub preflight, dry-run suppression, main output/exit handling and post-run write auditing remain native boundary behavior.",
      "Mandatory v1 runtime receipts, digests and provenance accompany execution; optional native main reasoning logging is not requested by this audit-body graph."
    ]
  },
  "extensions": {
    "mathformer.source": {
      "category": "hub",
      "native_id": "control:skill-coverage",
      "owner_skill": "skills/control/skill-hook-coverage-maximizer/SKILL.md",
      "contract": {
        "id": "control:skill-coverage",
        "summary": "Audit that non-wrapper skills are reachable from hooks or direct routes.",
        "family": "control",
        "kind": "validation",
        "safety": "read_only",
        "command": [
          "{python}",
          "skills/control/skill-hook-coverage-maximizer/scripts/audit_skill_hook_coverage.py",
          "--expect-ok",
          "--json"
        ],
        "depends_on": [],
